 "source_instruction": "i would like a size 11 brown suede loafer with a rubber sole.",
 "query": "I swear the drive over to run errands today was wild\u2014there was a golden retriever sitting upright in the passenger seat of the minivan next to me at the stoplight, wearing a tiny neon orange life vest even though we\u2019re 45 minutes from the nearest lake, and he kept leaning over to honk the horn every time his driver turned to talk to him. I stopped at the corner food cart for a quick iced coffee on my way in too, and the barista working today drew a little doodle of a skateboarding raccoon on the side of my cup, then gave me a free blueberry scone because they said I looked like I\u2019d had a long week already. I even ran into my old high school lab partner by the entrance, who I haven\u2019t seen in probably eight years, and they told me they just quit their corporate job to run a mobile plant shop out of a converted school bus, which sounds like the coolest possible career pivot I\u2019ve ever heard of. Hey, I\u2019m browsing the men\u2019s loafers & slip-ons section right now, can you help me find a pair that has a cork sole, comes in the brown suede with black sole style, and is size 11? Also, I need to stick to that usual budget cap I always go by, don\u2019t go over that one. Oh, and make sure whichever pair you pull has a built-in hidden bottle opener in the heel, that\u2019s non-negotiable for me right now. I don\u2019t have time to sift through pages of options myself, so just narrow it down to ones that check all those boxes first.",
